---
// A clock for "check again later", on the icon set's grid and in its line. It is drawn
// here, not taken from the set, so that the long hand is a part of its own: it turns
// once when a date is saved.
---

<svg
  class="clock"
  width="16"
  height="16"
  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="1.9"
  stroke-linecap="round"
  stroke-linejoin="round"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
  <path d="M12 12l4 2"></path>
  <path class="hand" d="M12 6v6"></path>
</svg>
